<title>USA: Zapata agrees to repurchase 6.7 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Zapata agrees to repurchase 6.7 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON, Texas 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zapata Corp said on Friday that it has agreed to repurchase roughly 6.7 million shares of its common stock for $4.52 per share, including commissions.</p>
<p>The transaction will be privately negotiated, the company added.</p>
<p>Earlier in the month, Zapata Corp, which deals in oil, natural gas, fish oil and fish meal, said it would buy back an additional 2.5 million shares, bringing a previously authorized repurchase plan to 7.5 million shares.</p>
